surname>Brener</surname><given-names>ND</given-names></name><name><surname>Wechsler</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><collab>Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC)</collab></person-group><article-title>Youth risk behavior surveillance&#x02013;United States, 2007</article-title><source>MMWR Surveill Summ</source><year>2008</year><volume>57</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>131</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18528314</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>W&#x000e4;rnberg</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Marcos</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Low-grade inflammation and the metabolic syndrome in children and adolescents</article-title><source>Curr Opin Lipidol</source><year>2008</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>11</fpage><lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18196981</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/MOL.0b013e3282f4096b</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Department of Statistics and Research, Ministry of Finance</collab></person-group><source>Statistical Codes of Districts, Municipalities, Communities and Quarters of Cyprus. Series I. Report no 3</source><year>2000</year><publisher-name>Cyprus: Printing Office of Republic of Cyprus, Nicosia</publisher-name><comment>(In Greek)</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lazarou</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Panagiotakos</surname><given-names>DB</given-names></name><name><surname>Matalas</surname><given-names>AL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Level of adherence to the Mediterranean diet among children from Cyprus: the CYKIDS study</article-title><source>Public Health Nutr</source><year>2008</year><publisher-name>Published